Subject: [PATCH 13/49] R1 tests: the three reviewers' witnesses as regression
 tests

lock_wait_stale_witness_test.go is the read-side review's command-level
witness (backup beside prune loses the backup; prune beside backup and restore
beside prune fail where stock succeeds), unchanged apart from its header.

lock_wait_dwell_witness_test.go ports the storage and the backup review's
API-level witnesses from internal/repository to cmd/restic, so that they
drive the wait work the commands use (backupIndexWaitWork). The stock-order
control is kept (TestWitnessLockDwellStockOrder).

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
